    "text": "Match List I with List II<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List I<br />\t\t\tNatural amino acid</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List II<br />\t\t\tOne Letter<br />\t\t\tCode</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">(A)</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Glutamic acid</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">(I)</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">(B)</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Glutamine</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">(II)</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">(C)</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Tyrosine</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">(III)</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">(D)</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Tryptophan</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">(IV)</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><br />Choose the correct answer from the options given below:",
